t/MMIO/startup and explicit allocation; verify image/link map and rejected unsupported services on execution or named emulator. DOM2 acceptance requires memory map, startup/reset, interrupt vectors, stack/static-allocation/section and panic/BSP records; typed volatile/ordered/capability-checked MMIO and audited wrappers; declared interrupt effects and synchronization. Exercise timer sensor reset/acknowledgement/buffer/panic behavior and UART, reject hidden hosted services and unauthorized MMIO, and emit image/link/source/audit maps with boot/simulator evidence. Dependencies: profile legality, native lowering and runtime memory/startup boundaries; physical memory representability remains separate from removed project accounting ; P6 target conformance requires explicit stack/static/region/arena/provider capacity/reset/failure policy and no hidden GC/host services; unknown stack use rejects in strict mode. Check device-map address/width/alignment/volatility/order/grants, interrupt source/priority/shared-state/atomic/reentrancy/stack/latency/context, and required physical loop/recursion/blocking-timeout evidence; missing evidence rejects or requires the policy-permitted unsafe audit. Reject invalid maps, missing device authority, host calls and unbounded handler behavior. Emit image/linker/memory/device/vector/interrupt/latency/safety manifests with source provenance. Physical memory/timing requirements are not compiler work allowances; product target choice remains unassessed\n\nSource basis: [Firmware contract](../../docs/phase-09-domain-specific-computing-coverage/125-dom2-firmware-and-embedded-domain-specification.md)", :after-sha256 "d9755539a554e13134e6b489efa9e02d6fc07e40b8f68ee76fcf493fcc476fa5"} {:path "specs/domains-workflow/tasks.md", :before-present? true, :criterion-ids ["acceptance/domain/gpu-dispatch" "acceptance/domain/gpu-kernel-validation" "acceptance/domain/gpu-reduction-integration"], :before-sha256 "baebb2475d84883890c0344d0b1a1ff2d5ec83fcc7d2080ec